    <sys:String x:Key="MostraTitolo">Show Passage</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraAiuto">Type the reference of the passage you want to display and choose the Bible translation(s) and/or commentaries you want to read. "Alternate Texts" shows one verse at a time in the different texts that are chosen. The text is opened in an editor window, where it can be modified, copied, or saved.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraRiferimento">Verses to Display:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraRiferimentoAiuto">Type here the reference of the passage you want to view, for example Gen 1:1-2, 1P 3:16. The app understands many different formats for the references.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraTesti">Texts to Show:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraTestiAiuto">Select the texts that you want to view. You can drag the items to reorder them; the custom order will be used the next time you run the program.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraSeleziona">Select All</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraDeseleziona">Unselect All</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraAlterna">Alternate Texts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraAlternaAiuto">Show the passage one verse at a time, and for every verse all of the selected texts are shown. Can be slow for long passages.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MostraMostra">Show Passage</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="MisureTitolo">Measures Converter</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MisureAiuto">On the left side, choose the unit you want to convert from, and type the number of that unit. On the right side, choose the unit you want to convert to, and the value in that unit will be shown.</sys:String>
